{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122366","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122366/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122366/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122366/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122366","id":5138762848,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABMktMYA","number":122366,"title":"`RenderingDevice.GetCapturedTimestampGpuTime()` suppose to return time in microseconds, but actually returns in nanoseconds.","user":{"login":"ChevyLevi","id":49272922,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5MjcyOTIy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49272922?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChevyLevi","html_url":"https://github.com/ChevyLevi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChevyLevi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChevyLevi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChevyLevi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChevyLevi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChevyLevi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChevyLevi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChevyLevi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChevyLevi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChevyLevi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518839,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg4Mzk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/documentation","name":"documentation","color":"ffddff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":343,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:28:22Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-08-13T07:06:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-25T16:27:19Z","closed_at":"2026-09-25T15:55:40Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in v4.7.stable.mono.official [5b4e0cb0f]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.stable.mono - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated AMD Radeon RX 6700S (Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.; 32.0.21045.1000) - AMD Ryzen 7 6800HS with Radeon Graphics (16 threads) - 35.73 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nAs the document shows, `RenderingDevice.GetCapturedTimestampGpuTime()` should:\n> Returns the timestamp in GPU time for the rendering step specified by index (in microseconds since the engine started)\n\nHowever, it actually returns in nanoseconds: \nthe MRP attached below shows that when calculating the same amount of time, the output GPU time is roughly 1000 times of CPU time. This bug exists both when using `D3D12` and vulkan.\n\nI did some digging and here is what I found in source code: \n* [Vulcan GPU TimeStamp implementation](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/4.7/drivers/vulkan/rendering_device_driver_vulkan.cpp#L6772-L6803)\n* [D3D12 GPU TimeStamp implementation](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/63b7e027254e6b77b3d1036c89973060fb5be088/drivers/d3d12/rendering_device_driver_d3d12.cpp#L5631-L5633)\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n* Open the MRP folder and run the following command in terminal (the example command is for windows):\n```shell\nGodot_v4.7-stable_mono_win64_console.exe `\n   --display-driver windows `\n   --rendering-driver vulkan `\n   --script res://timestamp_test.gd\n```\n* the expecting result is that the printed `GPU/CPU ratio` at around 1000;\n* change `--rendering-driver` to `d3d12`;\n* `GPU/CPU ratio` still at around 1000\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[gpu_timestamp_units_mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/31016588/gpu_timestamp_units_mrp.zip)\nNote: this MRP is made by LLM.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122366/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122366/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}